a complete transition

518
00:25:35,913 --> 00:25:38,847
from man to wolf.

519
00:25:38,847 --> 00:25:41,885
Your crazy experiments are
a disgrace to science.

520
00:25:41,885 --> 00:25:43,887
- Mr. Mooney.
- Gail Gordon.

521
00:25:43,887 --> 00:25:46,199
Those are the very words
you used in denouncing me

522
00:25:46,199 --> 00:25:47,822
