523
00:25:47,822 --> 00:25:52,067
Professor Fitzgerald...
Science!

524
00:25:52,067 --> 00:25:54,483
What do you know
about science?

525
00:25:54,483 --> 00:25:57,832
You with your hidebound
dogmas and shriveled mind

526
00:25:57,832 --> 00:25:59,281
