progress...

527
00:25:59,281 --> 00:26:01,352
Hey, it'’s col. Potter.
Harry Morgan.

528
00:26:01,352 --> 00:26:02,526
What is progress to you
with your foolish

529
00:26:02,526 --> 00:26:03,976
tampering with nature?

530
00:26:03,976 --> 00:26:06,288
I'’m glad you asked
that question,

531
00:26:06,288 --> 00:26:08,912
professor Hatfield.

532
00:26:08,912 --> 00:26:10,983
You also were one
of those stupid fools

533
00:26:10,983 --> 00:26:12,501
who raised their voices
against me.

534
00:26:12,501 --> 00:26:15,435
So he'’s talking to us.

535
00:26:15,435 --> 00:26:17,058
I'’ve got a question.

536
00:26:17,058 --> 00:26:19,336
But our armed forces
are not in combat

537
00:26:19,336 --> 00:26:21,890
