who fight with fanatical fury!

538
00:26:21,890 --> 00:26:23,133
Don'’t think he heard you.

539
00:26:23,133 --> 00:26:25,445
Well, that fanatical fury
will avail them nothing

540
00:26:25,445 --> 00:26:27,413
