regard of personal safety.

550
00:26:48,261 --> 00:26:49,573
[All]
Republicans?

551
00:26:49,573 --> 00:26:51,610
Such an army will be
invincible, gentlemen.

552
00:26:51,610 --> 00:26:55,441
Such an army will sweep
everything before it.

553
00:26:55,441 --> 00:26:59,169
Your scheme is too
utterly fantastic, Dr. Cameron.

554
00:26:59,169 --> 00:27:01,999
You'’re fools, all of you.
Four blind fools.

555
00:27:01,999 --> 00:27:03,414
Especially you,
