563
00:27:21,260 --> 00:27:25,195
No, Cameron, you'’re mad.
Stark raving mad.

564
00:27:25,195 --> 00:27:28,060
- And I for one am in favor--
- silence!

565
00:27:28,060 --> 00:27:29,371
