574
00:27:49,944 --> 00:27:51,600
You branded me
as a madman.

575
00:27:51,600 --> 00:27:54,534
Held me up to ridicule
before the whole world.

576
00:27:54,534 --> 00:27:57,158
But now it'’s time
for my revenge.

577
00:27:57,158 --> 00:28:01,369
- Petro will see to that.
- Sorry we said anything.

578
00:28:01,369 --> 00:28:03,440
There'’s no escape
for any of you.

579
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:05,511
You shall die
one by one

580
00:28:05,511 --> 00:28:07,893
