of he scientific marvel

581
00:28:07,893 --> 00:28:09,273
that you scoffed at.

582
00:28:09,273 --> 00:28:10,861
What a grouch.

583
00:28:10,861 --> 00:28:12,587
You can'’t intimidate us
with fantastic threats.

584
00:28:12,587 --> 00:28:14,969
You'’re a faker, Cameron,
a mad faker!

585
00:28:14,969 --> 00:28:16,246
We'’ll have you ostracized

586
00:28:16,246 --> 00:28:18,041
