for madmen.

588
00:28:19,836 --> 00:28:21,113
Like the Pentagon.

589
00:28:21,113 --> 00:28:23,563
And we'’ll see that you'’re
confined in one.

590
00:28:23,563 --> 00:28:25,842
You would think, since
