with the crust cut off.

594
00:28:34,885 --> 00:28:37,543
- Nut cups.
- You will see, gentlemen.

595
00:28:37,543 --> 00:28:39,027
You will see.

596
00:28:39,027 --> 00:28:40,304
[Petro growling]

597
