Next comes the ghost
of Christmas present.

598
00:28:44,239 --> 00:28:45,896
Christmas present,
for me?

599
00:28:45,896 --> 00:28:49,417
Okay, boy, okay,
i'’ll get you a liver snap.

600
00:28:49,417 --> 00:28:53,973
[Petro snarling]

601
