I hope he puts it
on his nose.

602
00:28:57,183 --> 00:28:58,840
[Wolf howling]

603
00:28:58,840 --> 00:29:01,394
What'’s the matter, boy?

604
00:29:01,394 --> 00:29:03,120
Skippy.

605
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:06,434
♪♪

606
00:29:06,434 --> 00:29:08,850
I'’d say skippy is what
