609
00:29:16,409 --> 00:29:20,068
Hey, he looks okay.

610
00:29:20,068 --> 00:29:23,451
Or as okay
as he ever will.

611
00:29:23,451 --> 00:29:25,902
I bet his breath is
terrible, though.

612
00:29:25,902 --> 00:29:29,008
But his mouth is cleaner
than yours and mine.

613
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:45,956
Tell me, doctor, how long
