633
00:30:55,854 --> 00:30:58,304
- Evening, miss lenora.
- Good evening, Petro.

634
00:30:58,304 --> 00:31:00,099
Well, night owl,
I was just coming down

635
00:31:00,099 --> 00:31:01,894
