641
00:31:14,873 --> 00:31:18,048
Yes, doctor.
Good night, miss lenora.

642
00:31:18,048 --> 00:31:21,189
- Good night, Petro.
- I'’ll be lurking for you.

643
00:31:21,189 --> 00:31:23,433
