698
00:33:26,590 --> 00:33:29,904
Well, you can trust me.
I wouldn'’t tell anybody.

699
00:33:29,904 --> 00:33:31,975
Well, we--

700
00:33:31,975 --> 00:33:33,597
cheese it, it'’s Alan Brady!

701
00:33:33,597 --> 00:33:37,153
No, I ain'’t sayin'’ nothin'’.

702
00:33:37,153 --> 00:33:40,018
Petro, did you fetch
