723
00:34:21,128 --> 00:34:22,267
He sure is...

724
00:34:22,267 --> 00:34:23,544
- Is this like
mice and men

725
00:34:23,544 --> 00:34:25,132
or flowers for algernon,
Joel?

726
00:34:25,132 --> 00:34:26,236
Neither--
just keep watching.

727
00:34:26,236 --> 00:34:27,617
Sorry.

728
00:34:27,617 --> 00:34:29,136
And he ate [indistinct].

729
00:34:29,136 --> 00:34:30,999
All right, lie down, Petro.

730
00:34:30,999 --> 00:34:34,279
Are you gonna strap me down
again tonight, doc?

731
00:34:34,279 --> 00:34:36,453
Well, certainly--
it'’s more necessary tonight

732
00:34:36,453 --> 00:34:38,179
